#lang palimpsest
// P18 — The oscillator (period 2). One application swaps the pair; a second
// swaps it back. The term returns to itself after exactly two rewrites — a
// 2-cycle, not a fixed point. (Run with just `osc` to see the halfway state.)
rule osc : (o ?a ?b) => (o ?b ?a)
main = (o x y)
run (osc ; osc)
